  "tips": "**Negatif dan pertanyaan lampau: didn't dan Did**\n\n- negatif: **didn't** + kata kerja **dasar** → *I **didn't go** to school.* (Saya tidak pergi ke sekolah.)\n- pertanyaan: **Did** + kata ganti + kata kerja **dasar** → ***Did** you **eat**?* (Kamu sudah makan?)\n- jawaban singkat: **Yes, I did.** / **No, I didn't.**\n\nBentuk lampaunya sudah ada di *did*, jadi kata kerjanya kembali ke bentuk dasar.\nKesalahan khas: *I didn't went* ✗ → *I didn't go* ✓. *Did you ate?* ✗ → *Did you eat?* ✓\n\n*didn't* sama untuk semua kata ganti: *she didn't, they didn't*.\n\nKata sifat dan tempat tetap memakai *was / were*: *I wasn't busy* ✓, bukan *I didn't busy* ✗.\nNegatif was/were: *was not* → **wasn't**, *were not* → **weren't** (*She wasn't sick. They weren't busy.*)\n\nKata baru: **homework** = pekerjaan rumah (PR).",
